  "description": "To take revenge on the husband who betrayed their nation, Adelaide returns from the brink of death. To get revenge on her husband, Adelaide decides to use her innocent brother-in-law, Cadis, and to let him go once her revenge is complete. After all, she was the poison he mistook for the Holy Grail.\n\n*“The only thing I’m afraid of… is being abandoned by you.”*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
